      "source_text": "……但我还是希望能在大舞台上回应大家的支持。\n我想实现大家投注在我身上的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad0f3de9cd47d8d2c9479ea4eb79fd4e15a7f0ebdb64ef8d7655480497c540d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
