    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc1ff2ade8816bb4d6e2a934",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到干劲十足的她影响，\n我开始在脑中想着今年“宝冢纪念”\n可能会有哪些选手参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "624a17c5b43945c0f28ec1343b70cbd2cf3774b5d2cea3b4082c2be7233e7a9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
