      "uid": "zhcn:2af1abfb8947bb33055b6e50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你怎么知道她们会参加宝冢啊？\n春季GⅠ不是也才刚开始而已吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6363635f9aa68a3dff2dbdad3ee3efe0b246690ece117c869250b7402d1e54f9",
