    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2493cdad448765a72aece7c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "简直就像完美的化身的目白麦昆。\n她用前列跑法碾压对手，\n以压倒性实力赢得许多胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a9437ba1474094cd0ad0247b0cbf39a0b41df244b0fbc9fee652cbf2ed67b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
