      "uid": "zhcn:c2fc52fe5c27fd640989a436",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一个则是目白赖恩。\n即使身陷苦境也绝不动摇，\n展现出身名门的觉悟，赢得许多支持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfc62299b9c977a562afe3fdf5e54a698d4382b40e49ff80a497125c88d5cfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
