    {
      "uid": "zhcn:809bd53c2f7ce67dfb902e35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我好怕让妹妹们觉得“为什么只有姐姐\n可以任性，不公平”。\n也怕我的任性会破坏家里的和谐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd7f8cc37c54b7be7bfa662c0802a29bf33e86873d00ad352dfce9df774041fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
