      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦咦～！？谢谢你安慰我啦……\n但我刚才说的不行不是这个意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "239489eb2470d634f8e5d923a11a84a3a5ff3d6a8223cf8d56f9fcfa01142327",
