      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是不是太沉迷于自己的世界里了啊？\n我应该更加拓展视野才对，需要反省。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d51a38b98b3af0d69937fe00f341131390a621a8d8db6a51aec4196645b769",
