      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咦──？训练员每次都这样，\n什么都要替我说话耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0936486bc5e4a7222bdef65222bf6492988848a7180401bab6beab2971716fce",
