      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而我身为她的训练员，\n就该继续在她身边协助她！\n我们的下一个目标是“宝冢纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df9d59d1f5b67420d7feecfd465736e3197ca8ef902b56df43ade3844a1b7a4a",
